This package is derived from TheKernel FD, readiness, and epoll lifecycle work
distributed under Apache-2.0. TheKernel in turn retains StarryOS and ArceOS
provenance for the surrounding kernel and generic wake-source implementation.

The Linux and FreeBSD source snapshots listed in VENDOR.md were consulted to
understand observable behavior and architecture. No Linux or FreeBSD source
text is copied into this package.
